                                <p class="benefit-desc">Gain knowledge through workshops and discussions.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="benefit-item">
                            <div class="benefit-icon-box icon-blue">
                                <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 7v10a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2V9a2 2 0 00-2-2h-6l-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2z"/></svg>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="benefit-title">Build real projects</h4>
                                <p class="benefit-desc">Turn ideas into impactful solutions.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="benefit-item">
                            <div class="benefit-icon-box icon-indigo">
                                <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"/></svg>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="benefit-title">Meet industry professionals</h4>
                                <p class="benefit-desc">Interact with experts and get career insights.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="benefit-item">
                            <div class="benefit-icon-box icon-green">
                                <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 3v4M3 5h4M6 17v4m-2-2h4m5-16l2.286 6.857L21 12l-5.714 2.143L13 21l-2.286-6.857L5 12l5.714-2.143L13 3z"/></svg>
